      MaskDescription "This subsystem contains an individual capacitor compone"
"nt, designed for use in high-performance power electronic circuits. The capac"
"itor's characteristics, such as capacitance, equivalent series resistance (ES"
"R), and equivalent series inductance (ESL), are all customizable and can be i"
"nitialized in the Simulation Parameters window (Ctrl+E). This setup is intend"
"ed to be compatible with a wide range of capacitor types, allowing for flexib"
"le application in different circuit configurations."
